// IntroString :
"P4227233550" "I hate to ask for help, but you see, I wrote a scathing piece in the latest issue of Paragon Times about the fashion used by Nemesis and his soldiers. I called them 'old-fashioned,' and said they needed to update their look for the new millennium. Well, apparently Nemesis himself read the article and was... perturbed. He left a message saying that I was on 'his list,' whatever that means. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Looks like I need a little hero protection.</A> If you can help me out, I can fashion you a costume in the latest of all trends. Your Super Group members will be so jealous!"
// AcceptString :
